{
    "id":  3437,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Connector for COB + SMD LED Strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65",
    "reference":  "90935-8-2",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eSolderless\u003cstrong\u003e connector\u003c/strong\u003e for non-waterproof IP65 \u003cstrong\u003eCOB and SMD strips\u003c/strong\u003e with\u003cstrong\u003e 8mm - 10mm\u003c/strong\u003e PCB.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 \u003c/strong\u003equick connector allows connections to be made on LED strips without the need for soldering by simply tightening the clips on the side of the connector. Super easy to fit.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eConnector for COB and SMD LED Strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP65 \u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith our \u003cstrong\u003econnector\u003c/strong\u003e you can connect all types of \u003cstrong\u003e8mm - 10mm LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e. It includes the connection cable for ease of use of the connector.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can use it with your 8mm - 10mm LED strips:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor COB LED strips.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor SMD LED strips.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is very easy to install thanks to the quick click system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou have to take into account the dimensions of the connector if you want to insert it in an aluminium or polycarbonate profile.\u003c/p\u003e",
